# Nothing here is generated at build time except providers/, which is committed
# on purpose: the files Nuvio fetches are the ones in the repo, so what a client
# downloads is always reviewable in the history rather than produced on the fly.
# `python build.py` regenerates them, and CI fails if they drift from src/.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
